// Mission briefing templates — one node per chapter tag (+ conditional suffix)
// Variables: {PlayerFaction}, {EnemyFaction}

title: retreat
---
{EnemyFaction} is pressing hard. Hold your ground and buy time for the withdrawal.
===

title: retreat_enemy_winning
---
We are being overrun. {EnemyFaction} shows no sign of stopping. Hold — or everything is lost.
===

title: assault
---
{EnemyFaction} is overextended. Strike now — this is the moment.
===

title: assault_player_stronger
---
{EnemyFaction} cannot match our strength. Overwhelm them. Leave nothing standing.
===

title: conquest
---
{EnemyFaction} controls this sector. {PlayerFaction} will not tolerate it. Crush them.
===

title: skirmish
---
This sector is contested. {EnemyFaction} holds a presence here. Clear them out.
===

title: skirmish_enemy_winning
---
{EnemyFaction} is gaining ground across the sector. We need a win here — any win.
===
